<title>SPAIN: POLL-Santander H1 net attributable seen up 20.8pct.</title>
<headline>POLL-Santander H1 net attributable seen up 20.8pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forecasts for first-half results for Spain's Grupo Santander. Numbers in billions of pesetas.</p>
<p>				   H1 97	  H1 96	 RANGE</p>
<p>    Net interest income   237.86	 191.78   232.62-242.01</p>
<p>    Operating income	119.85	  93.60   113.13-127.17</p>
<p>    Net attributable	 55.44	  45.90    53.48-56.14</p>
<p>NOTE - The group is expected to release results at the end of the month.</p>
<p>Contributors: BBV Interactivos, Benito y Monjardin, Inverban, AB Asesores, Ahorro Corp. Financiero, Beta Capital.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
